
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BALANCECALC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 OPENING-BALANCE PIC 9(7).
       01 DEPOSIT-AMOUNT PIC S9(7).
       01 UPDATED-BALANCE PIC 9(8).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           DISPLAY "ENTER OPENING BALANCE:"
           ACCEPT OPENING-BALANCE

           DISPLAY "ENTER DEPOSIT AMOUNT:"
           ACCEPT DEPOSIT-AMOUNT

           IF DEPOSIT-AMOUNT < 0
               DISPLAY "INVALID DEPOSIT AMOUNT"

           ELSE
               COMPUTE UPDATED-BALANCE =
                   OPENING-BALANCE + DEPOSIT-AMOUNT

               DISPLAY "UPDATED BALANCE: "
                   UPDATED-BALANCE
           END-IF

           STOP RUN.
